Package: RockShiny
Title: Rocksmith 2014 PSARC Note-Highway Player for Shiny
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "your.email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Unpacks Rocksmith 2014 .psarc archives (AES/zlib), parses XML and
    SNG note charts, converts Wwise audio for the browser and renders a
    Rocksmith-style 3D note highway through a custom Shiny output binding.
    A karaoke mode shows the lyrics of songs that have them, highlighted
    syllable by syllable in sync with the audio, in Shiny or as a standalone
    HTML page.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    shiny (>= 1.7.0),
    bslib,
    htmltools,
    jsonlite,
    later,
    xml2,
    openssl,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
SystemRequirements: vgmstream-cli (Wwise audio decoding), ffmpeg (audio encoding)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
